{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Port-Royal-des-Champs is quiet now. But it isn\u2019t empty.<br>The stones remember. The garden does too.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/c384d88f3ae2c1817fb17ca2df99dac2.avif?t=1773067767\" width=780 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Agn\u00e8s, a young peasant trusted with a noble task. The Abbess has given you the keys to her personal garden - a place even the mysterious Solitaires living near the abbey are forbidden to enter. What was once majestic has been swallowed by weeds and years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time. Pull back the wild growth, reveal old paths, and decide what this garden becomes. As the story advances, new areas open up, inviting you deeper into a holy place that\u2019s slowly waking again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/5bbbc9f536b3e821b88056a76fb40880.poster.avif?t=1773067767\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/5bbbc9f536b3e821b88056a76fb40880.webm?t=1773067767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/5bbbc9f536b3e821b88056a76fb40880.mp4?t=1773067767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes restoration is just patience.<br>Sometimes it\u2019s the first step into something larger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/be069abf9b5b592c4d7a97cc729cb4a3.avif?t=1773067767\" width=780 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The garden is alive with real flora, and it behaves like a real ecosystem. Plant seeds, water them, and learn what makes each species thrive. Soil type matters. Moisture matters. Even proximity to other plants matters. There\u2019s no rigid grid here - you\u2019re gardening in a natural, free-form space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the seasons turn, discover and identify plants across every stage of their growth. When the moment is right, gather flowers, leaves, and seeds for botany. Your knowledge grows alongside the garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/8b2f291ac11f8f0c71cb0877efc9f6f1.poster.avif?t=1773067767\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/8b2f291ac11f8f0c71cb0877efc9f6f1.webm?t=1773067767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/8b2f291ac11f8f0c71cb0877efc9f6f1.mp4?t=1773067767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notice what flourishes.<br>Notice what struggles.<br>Then gently make it right.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/87334b70fb51162fb0e9753d97671c98.avif?t=1773067767\" width=780 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This garden was never only a garden. Hidden objects lie in the overgrowth and ruins, waiting to be found. Each discovery fills out your collections and can trigger new quests and quiet conversations. The abbey holds a long history of wonders - and of things deliberately forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among what you uncover is a book written by a deceased spy. Its meaning is dangerous, and the wrong hands are already searching for it. Work with the local community to understand what it says before the British and French royals do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/3885a3db4908bd35548733fa6fd781d6.poster.avif?t=1773067767\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/3885a3db4908bd35548733fa6fd781d6.webm?t=1773067767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/3885a3db4908bd35548733fa6fd781d6.mp4?t=1773067767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dirt hides more than roots.<br>Keep digging.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/095707fd83b5ed764cc6bf175e68b5eb.avif?t=1773067767\" width=780 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even with court drama and espionage in the background, your days remain peaceful. The Abbess Garden is cozy at heart - a small world where you garden at your own pace, completing gentle quests and tending plants until they\u2019re happy. Progress the story whenever you feel ready, letting it unfold linearly as you restore life to the abbey grounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll meet NPCs based on real historical figures and events. You\u2019ll help neighbors. You\u2019ll piece together a quiet conspiracy. And somewhere in all that softness and sunlight, you may find a lover - a romance that grows naturally, like everything else here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/a40f391eabe67f9169f7ff599f645f5e.poster.avif?t=1773067767\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/a40f391eabe67f9169f7ff599f645f5e.webm?t=1773067767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/a40f391eabe67f9169f7ff599f645f5e.mp4?t=1773067767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sanctuary.<br>A mystery.<br>A garden that needs you.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The first flower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3411970/2332f4c9566a801bb7f1a2a788989d8b3e86589f.jpg"},{"name":"Enter the abbey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3411970/0ea90e978011ea578b6f8114ce6b0266aba0ea4e.jpg"},{"name":"The Abbess","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3411970/0a5a95e41de56d664d9d28158570aaa7942221ff.jpg"},{"name":"Fran\u00e7ois","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3411970/78e004c3a71650992337b506c7015ab86d691b12.jpg"},{"name":"The secret journal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3411970/16686560056465452a42755c81286ff919edf865.jpg"},{"name":"The ominous men","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3411970/7acc0cb05d17a68138169c8bec4244a750fe06c4.jpg"},{"name":"First kiss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3411970/11e0ee818e604b81fd076e43d144703e1b3a1ad2.jpg"},{"name":"A bigger garden","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3411970/0eef27cd8a6e5e284d7567df606f44e2d03d9b4f.jpg"},{"name":"Saying goodbye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3411970/e897a2d234c9994976fe9ae8f0f1df66af3b92f0.jpg"},{"name":"Poisonous","path":"https://cdn.aka