open up, inviting you deeper into a holy place that\u2019s slowly waking again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/5bbbc9f536b3e821b88056a76fb40880.poster.avif?t=1773067767\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/5bbbc9f536b3e821b88056a76fb40880.webm?t=1773067767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/5bbbc9f536b3e821b88056a76fb40880.mp4?t=1773067767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes restoration is just patience.<br>Sometimes it\u2019s the first step into something larger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/be069abf9b5b592c4d7a97cc729cb4a3.avif?t=1773067767\" width=780 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The garden is alive with real flora, and it behaves like a real ecosystem. Plant seeds, water them, and learn what makes each species thrive. Soil type matters. Moisture matters. Even proximity to other plants matters. There\u2019s no rigid grid here - you\u2019re gardening in a natural, free-form space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the seasons turn, discover and identify plants across every stage of their growth. When the moment is right, gather flowers, leaves, and seeds for botany. Your knowledge grows alongside the garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411970/extras/8b2f291ac11f8f0c71cb0877efc9f6f1.poster.avif?t=1773067767\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea